                "text": "Time and time again, we've seen how prior authorization has led to dangerous delays in care and undermined access to healthcare for our seniors.\n\nThat is why I joined my colleagues to introduce the Seniors Deserve SMARTER Care Act, which will cut through red tape to ensure that seniors receive the timely care that they need.\n\nhttps://t.co/xzV3hu6Wco",
