                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am honored and proud to be elected as the first chair of the Democratic Doctors Caucus!\n\nOur nation\u2019s healthcare system is at a pivotal moment. As chair of this caucus, I look forward to creating solutions to lower costs, put patients and doctors back in the driver's seat, and ensure our healthcare system works for all Americans.\n\nhttps://t.co/tgqKEqCTyf",
