                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I had a wonderful meeting with Dr. Cirillo, president of the American College of Emergency Physicians (@ACEPNation), this week to discuss the importance of protecting Medicare access and improving patient care. https://t.co/TflqGUDcZq",
