                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I spoke with constituents today about how the expiration of critical healthcare tax credits will make their healthcare unaffordable, limiting access to quality care.\n\nIf you\u2019ve seen your healthcare prices rise, I want to hear your story so I can continue to raise awareness. Click the link below to share your story! \n\nhttps://t.co/iZvfDa4xqE",
